.TH start-cli-registry-info-set-trust-signers 1  "set-trust-signers "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-registry\-info\-set\-trust\-signers \- Select the signers proposed for package trust; no signers clears the selection
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli registry info set\-trust\-signers\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fISIGNER\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Select the signers proposed for package trust; no signers clears the selection
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fISIGNER\fR]
Existing signer IDs to propose for package trust
